# upstream's nine scene tests, in order on one screen. The first screen
# has the heading, the three fields and a disabled Subscribe (scene 1).
# scene 2: a short name is described by its error
name A
# scene 3: a malformed address is described by its error
email not-an-email
# scene 4: with a valid name, a well-formed address is Checking... and the
# button stays disabled; once the list answers, the button is enabled
name Alice
email alice@example.com
wait 300
# scene 5: an address on the list is described as taken
email test@example.com
wait 300
# scene 6: valid name and email enable the button
email alice@example.com
wait 300
# scene 7: a submit shows Subscribing..., disabled, then the welcome status
# and Subscribe again
submit
wait 300
# scene 8: a refused submit (Enter in the form) shows the alert
email bob@mail.invalid
wait 300
enter
wait 300
# scene 9: Enter on a form that is not ready is refused: the button stays
# disabled
name A
enter
